A generation later, Paul reads the same verse aloud as his own marching orders. The mission to the nations and the raising of the tribes are one sentence in the source both moments were taught from.$card$, '{"Isaiah 49:5-6","Luke 2:29-32","Acts 13:47"}'::TEXT[], 'free', NOW())
