*But this is that which was spoken by the prophet Joel; And it shall come to pass in the last days, saith Elohim (God), I will pour out of my Spirit upon all flesh: and your sons and your daughters shall prophesy, and your young men shall see visions, and your old men shall dream dreams: And on my servants and on my handmaidens I will pour out in those days of my Spirit; and they shall prophesy:* (Acts 2:16-18)

