VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'isaiah' AND c.chapter_number = 52 AND v.verse_number = 9), 'good_news', 'The good news', 'A Daughter of Asher, Looking for Redemption', $card$*And there was one Anna, a prophetess, the daughter of Phanuel, of the tribe of Aser: she was of a great age, and had lived with an husband seven years from her virginity;* (Luke 2:36)

*And she coming in that instant gave thanks likewise unto Yahuah (Lord), and spake of him to all them that looked for redemption in Jerusalem.* (Luke 2:38)

