*Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done in earth, as it is in heaven.* (Matthew 6:10)

*Doubtless thou art our father, though Abraham be ignorant of us, and Yashar'el (Israel) acknowledge us not: thou, O Yahuah (LORD), art our father, our redeemer; thy name is from everlasting.* (Isaiah 63:16)

