*Sing, O ye heavens; for Yahuah (LORD) hath done it: shout, ye lower parts of the earth: break forth into singing, ye mountains, O forest, and every tree therein: for Yahuah (LORD) hath redeemed Jacob, and glorified himself in Yashar'el (Israel).* (Isaiah 44:23)

