*But because Yahuah (LORD) loved you, and because he would keep the oath which he had sworn unto your fathers, hath Yahuah (LORD) brought you out with a mighty hand, and redeemed you out of the house of bondmen, from the hand of Pharaoh king of Egypt.* (Deuteronomy 7:8)

