VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'isaiah' AND c.chapter_number = 9 AND v.verse_number = 21), 'gathering', 'The gathering', 'The envy of Ephraim shall depart — the oldest feud in the family', $card$*Manasseh, Ephraim; and Ephraim, Manasseh: and they together shall be against Yahudah (Judah). For all this his anger is not turned away, but his hand is stretched out still.* (Isaiah 9:21)

*And he shall set up an ensign for the nations, and shall assemble the outcasts of Yashar'el (Israel), and gather together the dispersed of Yahudah (Judah) from the four corners of the earth.* (Isaiah 11:12)

