VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'amos' AND c.chapter_number = 9 AND v.verse_number = 9), 'gathering', 'The gathering', 'Sifted among all nations, and not one grain falls', $card$*Therefore fear thou not, O my servant Jacob, saith Yahuah (LORD); neither be dismayed, O Yashar'el (Israel): for, lo, I will save thee from afar, and thy seed from the land of their captivity; and Jacob shall return, and shall be in rest, and be quiet, and none shall make him afraid.* (Jeremiah 30:10)

*For I am with thee, saith Yahuah (LORD), to save thee: though I make a full end of all nations whither I have scattered thee, yet will I not make a full end of thee: but I will correct thee in measure, and will not leave thee altogether unpunished.* (Jeremiah 30:11)

