*And he said, Behold, I make a covenant: before all thy people I will do marvels, such as have not been done in all the earth, nor in any nation: and all the people among which thou art shall see the work of Yahuah (LORD): for it is a terrible thing that I will do with thee.* (Exodus 34:10)

