VALUES ((SELECT v.id FROM verses v JOIN chapters c ON c.id = v.chapter_id JOIN books b ON b.id = c.book_id JOIN editions e ON e.id = b.edition_id WHERE e.slug = 'canon' AND b.slug = 'numbers' AND c.chapter_number = 27 AND v.verse_number = 17), 'gathering', 'The gathering', 'Scattered as sheep having no shepherd — and the harvest is the gathering', $card$*But when he saw the multitudes, he was moved with compassion on them, because they fainted, and were scattered abroad, as sheep having no shepherd.* (Matthew 9:36)

*Which may go out before them, and which may go in before them, and which may lead them out, and which may bring them in; that the congregation of Yahuah (LORD) be not as sheep which have no shepherd.* (Numbers 27:17)

